Package: com.keyword.smsalert
Name: KeywordSMSAlert
Version: 1.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Alerts (vibration + sound) when an incoming SMS matches a keyword, and stops the alert when the power button is pressed. SMS detection runs in imagent, the alert engine and the power button watcher run in SpringBoard. Includes a Settings pane (Settings -> KeywordSMSAlert, needs PreferenceLoader). Designed for Dopamine RootHide / roothide on iOS 15.4.1.
Maintainer: KeywordSMSAlert
Author: KeywordSMSAlert
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
